react-video-ascii
https://github.com/LucasHJin/react-video-ascii
Copyright (c) Lucas Jin

ytui's glow and braille renderers (src/render.rs) and the character shape
vectors (src/glyphs.rs) are translated from react-video-ascii's two WebGL
passes (src/shaders/fragment_pass1.glsl, src/shaders/fragment.glsl) and
src/lib/ascii-utils.ts: the six-circle shape sampling, the shape exponent,
the default character set, the HSL brightness and saturation grade and the
background-opacity blend, with the same defaults. The braille mode is ytui's
own extension of that look.

